data complement_arrow_post_exit_wave1_breadth_note: String = "complement infer refuses because match patterns use dag_complement_lit_* (unsupported by infer_bool_literal_pattern_classify — only dag_token_kw_true/false). Refuse is fail-closed-correct for that unsupported shape. Counted deficit: ground complement_lit on the bool-literal authority (post-exit breadth); target witness is then complement_arrow_real_infer_holds."
